From 42ff776dc5def0fee43055c6aeab59500867904d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Elliott <keith@resonantrhythm.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 03:34:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(frequency): prepare Wave 2 agent and media worker images

Local preparation only; not pushed. Merging to main is production
authorization: Argo CD rolls frequency-worker, so merge only at step 6 of
frequency-music docs/wave2-rollout-packet.md after the backend deploy.

- Agent worker: frequency-music-agent@sha256:68538360 (frequency-music main
  at 6f332386, publish-agent-image run 38995835502; attestation verified
  with gh 2.102.0 against the workflow, source digest, refs/heads/main and
  a GitHub-hosted runner). The Harbor copy has the same digest. The pod
  template annotation, the process monitor's IMAGE and its CronJob image
  follow it. 91cb3047 changes nothing under agent/ or convex/shared/.
- AGENT_OUTBOX_DIR=/data/outbox on the retained frequency-state volume, as
  frequency-music docs/pipeline-recovery.md requires for Kubernetes. The
  worker treats that directory as its durable root and refuses to spool
  when it is missing, so an outbox-dir init container from the same image
  creates it (mode 0700, UID 1001) before the worker starts.
- Media worker: MEDIA_JOB_KINDS gains litmusRender (renderer 0.3.0, #140).
  The image tag lives in the host's untracked .env, not here; set
  MEDIA_IMAGE_TAG=sha-6f332386d01089270b740ea009ee5088d8534a91@sha256:2b58a8ace6bb080f1b5515f3ba89e687df357ab3d2f92b583114c35d522c971d
  on ai-5090-02 in the same deploy (publish-media-image run 38995835619,
  attestation verified the same way).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
