 # the registry pull); otherwise a published `sha-<commit>` tag. CI publishes
 # only immutable `sha-<commit>` tags, never `latest`. To pin the bytes, append
 # the digest: MEDIA_IMAGE_TAG=sha-<commit>@sha256:<digest>.
-# compose.yaml claims the wave 1 job kinds, so a published tag must come from
-# frequency-music main at or after the wave 1 merge (#77); an older image
